  "key_concepts": [
    "Import Select SOP loads selected geometry primitives from USD COMP or FBX COMP import parents.",
    "It supports imported mesh, points, NURBS curves/patches, and Basis Curves paths exposed by the parent import.",
    "Merged geometry can create an adjacent Info DAT with original primitive paths.",
    "When `useparentanim` is disabled, the local Playback page controls timing, trim, cueing, and extension.",
    "Straight-to-GPU behavior is controlled by the import parent, so CPU readback assumptions depend on the parent COMP."
  ]
